{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":502181,"name":"Ahmed Elkiki","username":"Ahmed_Elkiki","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/a/a587f6/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-27T17:33:29.247Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502181-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502181-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502181-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502181-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSince updating Grok Bot about a week ago (around September 20, 2026), none of my bots can be loaded. The app shows “Can’t reach your computer. Your Bots are safe, they just can’t be loaded right now.” Retry does nothing. Recover computer fails. Reset fails with “The reset couldn’t finish. Grok Bot’s computer may be in a partial state.” In-app Send Feedback also fails with “We couldn’t deliver this report.”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502181-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502181-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOpen Grok Bot.\u003cbr\u003e\nSidebar shows “Can’t reach your computer.”\u003cbr\u003e\nClick Retry: no change.\u003cbr\u003e\nClick Recover computer: fails.\u003cbr\u003e\nRun Reset: fails, partial state warning.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502181-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502181-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAgent computer reachable, bots load, files and logins preserved.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502181-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502181-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/3/6/36ed3e9e43185147cef52ee0f59de0bfbd718008.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/7PU4OnaC2haKJvNVr1GjCsZxyKk.png?dl=1\" title=\"Screenshot 2026-09-27 132319.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/3/6/36ed3e9e43185147cef52ee0f59de0bfbd718008.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-27 132319.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"7PU4OnaC2haKJvNVr1GjCsZxyKk\" width=\"580\" height=\"500\" data-dominant-color=\"C6C6C6\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eScreenshot 2026-09-27 132319.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e612×527 11.5 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/2/3/2364777a31c06835e4dd26298c8ad1e9570d2602.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/535XxL8GAj4r1inlWq9KL7ih9qq.png?dl=1\" title=\"Screenshot 2026-09-27 132337.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/2/3/2364777a31c06835e4dd26298c8ad1e9570d2602_2_690x370.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-27 132337.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"535XxL8GAj4r1inlWq9KL7ih9qq\" width=\"690\" height=\"370\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/2/3/2364777a31c06835e4dd26298c8ad1e9570d2602_2_690x370.png, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/2/3/2364777a31c06835e4dd26298c8ad1e9570d2602_2_1035x555.png 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/2/3/2364777a31c06835e4dd26298c8ad1e9570d2602_2_1380x740.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F9F9\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eScreenshot 2026-09-27 132337.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1500×806 14.4 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/c/c/ccbc42251dcec6cc0f4c4a3e2a3422db9db1b9dc.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/tdaKeqlZjWfKWZsEv5X0xYuNbeQ.png?dl=1\" title=\"Screenshot 2026-09-27 132245.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/c/c/ccbc42251dcec6cc0f4c4a3e2a3422db9db1b9dc_2_690x325.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-27 132245.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"tdaKeqlZjWfKWZsEv5X0xYuNbeQ\" width=\"690\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/c/c/ccbc42251dcec6cc0f4c4a3e2a3422db9db1b9dc_2_690x325.png, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/c/c/ccbc42251dcec6cc0f4c4a3e2a3422db9db1b9dc_2_1035x487.png 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/c/c/ccbc42251dcec6cc0f4c4a3e2a3422db9db1b9dc_2_1380x650.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"8B8B8B\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eScreenshot 2026-09-27 132245.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e2432×1146 40.7 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502181-operating-system-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502181-operating-system-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWindows 10/11\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502181-version-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502181-version-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot: 0.57.1\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502181-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502181-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: which model did you use?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuilt-in Grok Bot agent computer (not a model issue)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502181-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-9\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502181-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-9\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: add Request ID with privacy disabled\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo request ID available. The app cannot reach the agent computer, and in-app Send Feedback also fails to deliver.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502181-additional-information-10\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502181-additional-information-10\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStarted after updating the app about a week ago. Retry, Recover computer and Reset all fail; I have stopped running Reset to avoid worsening the partial state. Please rebuild my agent computer from the backend and confirm my files, bots and logins are preserved. Location: Dubai, UAE. I only use the Grok Bot desktop app, not the Cursor IDE.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502181-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-11\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502181-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-11\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes - Cursor is unusable\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-27T17:33:43.796Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":43,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":176.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":173136,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-cant-reach-your-computer-for-7-days-since-update-recover-and-reset-failed-partial-state","display_username":"Ahmed Elkiki","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":140020,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-cant-reach-your-computer-for-7-days-since-update-recover-and-reset-failed-partial-state/173136/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":true,"can_vote":false},{"id":502188,"name":"Ahmed Elkiki","username":"Ahmed_Elkiki","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/a/a587f6/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-27T17:38:48.808Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eI tried the sign out and sign-in method described in similar topics. The same problem persists and now even my name doesn’t show any more at the bottom left corner, it’s now showing “?”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/e/6/e65e7e31afb5e251642dc79dd137666824628c80.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/wRWgDKA8ZroAgX1HmRMY8XRk0tG.png?dl=1\" title=\"image\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/e/6/e65e7e31afb5e251642dc79dd137666824628c80_2_690x410.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"wRWgDKA8ZroAgX1HmRMY8XRk0tG\" width=\"690\" height=\"410\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/e/6/e65e7e31afb5e251642dc79dd137666824628c80_2_690x410.png, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/e/6/e65e7e31afb5e251642dc79dd137666824628c80_2_1035x615.png 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/e/6/e65e7e31afb5e251642dc79dd137666824628c80_2_1380x820.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFBFB\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eimage\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e2238×1332 37.9 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":4,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-27T17:38:48.808Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":3,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":15.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":173136,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-cant-reach-your-computer-for-7-days-since-update-recover-and-reset-failed-partial-state","display_username":"Ahmed Elkiki","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":140020,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-cant-reach-your-computer-for-7-days-since-update-recover-and-reset-failed-partial-state/173136/4","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":true},{"id":502466,"name":"Mohit","username":"mohitjain","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/mohitjain/{size}/100229_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-28T08:29:24.969Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/ahmed_elkiki\"\u003e@Ahmed_Elkiki\u003c/a\u003e,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYour bots, files and logins are safe on your computer, and it’s running fine on our side, so please don’t run Reset again. The issue is that since the update, the app on this PC can’t connect out to our servers (that’s why Retry, Recover, Reset and Send Feedback all fail, and why signing out left a “?”). This is almost always security software intercepting the connection.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIn a browser, open \u003ca href=\"https://api2.cursor.sh/\"\u003ehttps://api2.cursor.sh/\u003c/a\u003e, click the padlock, and check “Issued by”. It should say Amazon. If it names your antivirus (Kaspersky, ESET, Avast, Bitdefender, Norton), that’s the cause.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIn that antivirus, add Grok Bot as a trusted app with HTTPS / “encrypted connection” scanning turned off for it (just pausing protection often isn’t enough). If you use a VPN or proxy, pause it.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFully quit Grok Bot from the tray, reopen, and give it a couple of minutes. (Still stuck? Try once on a phone hotspot with VPN/proxy off.)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf none of that helps, reinstall the latest from \u003ca href=\"https://x.ai/bot\"\u003ehttps://x.ai/bot\u003c/a\u003e. Your bots and files live on the computer, so it won’t touch them.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThen let me know what the padlock showed and which antivirus/VPN you use. You shouldn’t be hitting this and it’s not something you misconfigured; it’s an issue we’re tracking.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":7,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-28T08:40:03.714Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":11.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":173136,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-cant-reach-your-computer-for-7-days-since-update-recover-and-reset-failed-partial-state","display_username":"Mohit","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":3,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://api2.cursor.sh/","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":4},{"url":"https://x.ai/bot","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":1}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":103596,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-cant-reach-your-computer-for-7-days-since-update-recover-and-reset-failed-partial-state/173136/7","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":true},{"id":503679,"name":"Ahmed Elkiki","username":"Ahmed_Elkiki","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/a/a587f6/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-29T19:05:58.781Z","cooked":"\u003caside class=\"quote group-CursorStaff\" data-username=\"mohitjain\" data-display-name=\"Mohit\" data-post=\"7\" data-topic=\"173136\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"quote-controls\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cimg alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://sea3.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/mohitjain/48/100229_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"\u003e Mohit:\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://api2.cursor.sh\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003ehttps://api2.cursor.sh\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHi Mohit, that was it. The certificate showed “Kaspersky Anti-Virus Personal Root Certificate” instead of Amazon. Adding Grok Bot as a trusted application in Kaspersky Plus with traffic scanning disabled fixed it. Thanks for the help.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":8,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-29T19:05:58.781Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":7,"quote_count":1,"incoming_link_count":2,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":0.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":173136,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-cant-reach-your-computer-for-7-days-since-update-recover-and-reset-failed-partial-state","display_username":"Ahmed Elkiki","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_